					<li>AI Engineering & Machine Learning Solutions</li>
					<li>Agentic AI Development</li>
					<li>Generative AI & Large Language Model Integration</li>
					<li>AI Automation & Intelligent Workflows</li>
					<li>Custom Software Development</li>
					<li>Platform Engineering</li>
					<li>Cloud & DevOps Engineering</li>
					<li>Enterprise Application Modernization</li>
					<li>IT Consulting Services</li>
					<li>Technology Strategy & Architecture</li>
